<title>USA: TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $303,000</p>
<p>Infiniti Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Nevile Godwin (South</p>
<p>Africa) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>3-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Roberto Jabali (Brazil)</p>
<p>1-6 6-3 7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Marcos Ondruska (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>6-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 7-5</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) beat 7-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat 8-Alex O'Brien (U.S) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Doug Flach (U.S.) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Glenn Weiner (U.S.) beat Bob Bryan (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Mahesh Bhupathi (India) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Olivier Delaitre (France) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
